      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The `kSpeechNoSpeechInterrupt` key is used to control the behavior of [`SpeakCFString(_:_:_:)`](1461621-speakcfstring.md) when it is called on a speech channel that is busy.",
      "normalizedSource": "The `kSpeechNoSpeechInterrupt` key is used to control the behavior of [`SpeakCFString(_:_:_:)`](1461621-speakcfstring.md) when it is called on a speech channel that is busy.",
