      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "When `kSpeechNoSpeechInterrupt` is not specified in the `options` dictionary (or if it is specified with the value `kCFBooleanFalse`), `SpeakCFString` immediately interrupts the speech currently being produced on the specified speech channel and the new `aString` text is spoken.",
      "documentTitle": "kSpeechNoSpeechInterrupt",
